9220/extras/53a6603758f0358a125c5624a982c27a.mp4?t=1752271453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Fight 50+ unique bosses! Explore the catalogue of items! As you play, bosses will appear, each with their own unique attacks and abilities. Each stage has their own set of bosses. The more you play, the more you will become familiar with the available items, increasing your odds of success.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099220/extras/ed503237b3066ab54b3365769fdd4f43.webp?t=1752271453\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099220/extras/5c18c7765bcd377c979ad18dc7b563c2.poster.avif?t=1752271453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099220/extras/5c18c7765bcd377c979ad18dc7b563c2.webm?t=1752271453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099220/extras/5c18c7765bcd377c979ad18dc7b563c2.mp4?t=1752271453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Currently, there are 30+ playable characters. As the game is still in Early Access, we have plans to continually add more and more playable characters, each with their own unique set of skills and playstyles for you to try.",
